    {
        "content": "<p>I've tried to do <code>set_option linter.directoryDependency false</code> but if I put it before the module docstring then it would give me the error saying module docstring should be the first thing I put in this file, but if I put it after the module docstring then the previous error wouldn't go away... <span aria-label=\"cry\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f622\" role=\"img\" title=\"cry\">:cry:</span></p>",
