    {
        "content": "<p>You need to add a new exception to <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/blob/1e089a241eac369d195d4e785b997c9232faed92/Mathlib/Tactic/Linter/DirectoryDependency.lean#L592-L613\">https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/blob/1e089a241eac369d195d4e785b997c9232faed92/Mathlib/Tactic/Linter/DirectoryDependency.lean#L592-L613</a>. I think it is very reasonable to import <code>Topology</code> in the folder <code>RepresentationTheory/Continuous</code>.</p>",
