        "sender_full_name": "Christian Merten",
        "timestamp": 1778260315
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Thanks! Btw is this action transitive?  i.e if I do this for <code>Basic.lean</code> and I created <code>Subrepresentation.lean</code> importing <code>Basic.lean</code>, do I need to add it to the <code>DirectoryDependency</code> again?</p>",
