    {
        "content": "<p>The exception is for a whole folder, so if you add a line like</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"ss\">`Mathlib.RepresentationTheory.Continuous</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`Mathlib.Topology</span><span class=\"o\">),</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>the linter will be disabled for all files in the <code>RepresentationTheory/Continuous</code> folder.</p>",
